version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vianneydls/metastability-structured-populations"
url: "https://vianneydls.github.io/metastability-structured-populations/"
abstract: >
  Python simulation code and interactive web simulator
  accompanying the article "Metastability of a stochastic
  competitive model with large phenotypic diversity".
  The software implements an individual-based stochastic
  population model with non-local competition and its
  deterministic large-population limit.
keywords:
  - metastability
  - structured populations
  - stochastic population dynamics
  - individual-based models
  - adaptive dynamics
  - Gillespie algorithm
